  "ruleText": "Par 303.03 Conduct of Medical Parole Hearings. The board shall ask the director of medical and forensic services or designee to attend the hearing and answer questions from board members.\n\nSource. #9255, eff 9-6-08, EXPIRED: 9-6-16\n\nNew. #12158, eff 4-7-17",
